{"code":"zh-Hant","nativeName":"繁體中文","entries":[{"key":"imagePickup.popup.rejected.title","value":"共享圖片已被拒絕"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.title","value":"共享圖片數量上限"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.batchNotice.title","value":"圖片批次提示"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.animatedBatch.title","value":"動態圖片批次"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.accept","value":"確定"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.unknownFile","value":"未知檔案"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.defaultReason","value":"無法匯入圖片。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.rejection.description","value":"<b>檔案：</b>{0}\n\n圖片未被匯入。請修正下方所述問題後再試一次。\n\n<b>原因：</b>{1}"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.summary","value":"同時最多可以擁有 <b>{0}</b> 張共享圖片。仍在解碼的圖片也會計入此上限。\n\n你目前有 <b>{1}</b> 張使用中或等待處理的圖片。 "},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.allowedSome","value":"所選 <b>{1}</b> 張圖片中僅允許了 <b>{0}</b> 張，其餘圖片已被封鎖。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.limit.noneImported","value":"沒有匯入其他圖片。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.animated.warning","value":"此批次包含 <b>{0}</b> 張動態圖片。靜態海報會先顯示，但為了避免傳輸中斷，動畫資料會逐張傳送。較大的動態圖片批次可能需要明顯更長的時間才能與其他使用者完成同步。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.reason.adminLocked","value":"管理員已在此伺服器上鎖定共享圖片。"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.reason.animationStartFailed","value":"無法開始處理動態圖片：{0}"},{"key":"imagePickup.popup.reason.adminLockedDuringDecode","value":"GIF 解碼期間，管理員鎖定了共享圖片。"}]}
